OL,3,GNEWSAFour-year-old girl dies after fall
OL,4,Afrom tower block
OL,5,
OL,6,FA four-year-old girl has died after
OL,7,Ffalling from a tower block in East
OL,8,FLondon.
OL,10,FThe Metropolitan Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to the scene at an address
OL,12,Fin St Paul's Road, Barking, at about
OL,13,F11:00 BST on Saturday morning,
OL,14,Ffollowing reports that a child had
OL,15,Ffallen from height.
OL,17,FParamedics from the London Ambulance
OL,18,FService gave first aid and the child
OL,19,Fwas taken to hospital, but later died
OL,20,Ffrom her injuries.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
